646
00:28:06.600 --> 00:28:08.320
leaving their dead and wounded on the field.

647
00:28:08.520 --> 00:28:09.920
I went over the field,

648
00:28:10.100 --> 00:28:12.360
such a sight I never wished to see again.

649
00:28:12.860 --> 00:28:14.340
Every conceivable wound

650
00:28:14.340 --> 00:28:15.800
that can be thought of was there.

651
00:28:16.080 --> 00:28:17.460
There were so many wounded

652
00:28:17.460 --> 00:28:19.680
